description.p:
Embodiments of the present invention shall now be - described, by way of example only, with reference to the accompanying drawings in which:- 

Fig. 1 is a part cross-sectional side elevation of a vehicle according to the present invention installed in a pipeline; Fig. 2 is a part cross-sectional end elevation showing the vehicle of Fig. 1 installed in a pipeline; Fig. 3 is a side elevation of a drive mechanism for use with the vehicle of Figs 1 and 2; Fig. 4 is a end elevation of the drive mechanism of Fig. 3; Fig. 5 is a partly cross-sectional side elevation of a power generator for use with the vehicle of the present invention; Fig. 6 is an end elevation of the power generator of Fig. 5; Fig. 7 is a schematic side elevation of an annularly mounted power generator; Fig. 8 is an enlarged view of the power generator of Fig. 7 ; Fig. 9 is an enlarged side elevation of a electric mechanical power generator; Fig. 10 is a side elevation of an alternative embodiment of a vehicle; Fig. 11 is a side elevation of a third embodiment of a vehicle; Fig. 12 is a isometric view of the power generator of Figs 7 to 9; Fig. 13 is a side elevation of a power means for use with the present invention; Fig. 14 is a schematic side elevation of a fourth embodiment of the present invention; 

Fig. 15 is an isometric view of the vehicle of the Fig. 14; Fig. 16 is a side elevation of a fifth embodiment of a vehicle; Figs 17a to 17c illustrate a helix drive assembly; Fig. 18 shows an alternative wheel drive assembly; Fig. 19 shows a caterpillar or track drive assembly; Fig. 20 shows a trailer attached to a vehicle; Fig. 21 is a sectional perspective view of a sixth embodiment of a vehicle; Fig. 22 is a side view of the vehicle of Fig. 21, showing a line drawing of the vehicle; Fig. 23 is a side view of the vehicle of Fig. 21, showing an exterior view of the vehicle; Fig. 24 is end view of the vehicle of Fig. 21; Fig. 25 is a perspective view of the vehicle of Fig. 21; Fig. 26 is a side view of a seventh embodiment of a vehicle; Fig. 27 is perspective view of the vehicle of Fig. 26; Fig. 28 is a side view of an eighth embodiment of a vehicle; Fig. 29 is a shaded side view of the vehicle of Fig. 28; Fig. 30 is a perspective view of the vehicle of Fig. 28; 

 Fig. 31 is a second perspective view of the vehicle of Fig. 28; Fig. 32 is a sectional perspective view of the vehicle of Fig. 28 in use; and, Fig. 33 is a second sectional perspective view of the vehicle of Fig. 28 in use.
